**命题151.3（固定接收器的有限参数夹逼）。** 记 $[t]_+=\max(t,0)$。则

$$
\boxed{
\begin{aligned}
e_{148}(p)\ge\sqrt{xp}\bigl[
&\lambda\sqrt{x^2\lambda^2+p\kappa^2}\\
&-\nu\sqrt{x^2\nu^2+p\kappa^2}
-x\mu^2
\bigr]_+ ,
\end{aligned}
}
\tag{151.11}
$$

且

$$
\boxed{
e_{148}(p)\le
\mu^2\left(
\frac{\sqrt x}{\lambda+\nu}+\frac{x}{2}
\right).
}
\tag{151.12}
$$

